          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mutakolanga ekindi ku bintu ebyo waire ekirala kiti, kuba kibafuula abatali balongoofu. Ebyo byonabyona n'ebyafuula abantu abamaghanga agandi agatantya okuba abatali balongoofu, ge ndi kubinga mu nsi eno okuleetamu imwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebikolwa byaibwe byafuula ensi eno obutaba nongoofu, kye nva ndi kubabonereza nga mbabingira kuliya okubamaliramu irala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu abo baakolanga ebyenhinhalwa ebyo byonabyona, baaleetera ensi obutaba nongoofu. Aye imwe mutabikolanga. Mwenamwena Abaisiraeli n'abasenze abaasenga mu imwe, mugemenga amateeka n'ebiragiro byange, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.26+LEV.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.26",
              "LEV.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mulobe kubingibwa mu nsi eno ng'oti n'abantu abamaghanga abaabasooka okugibaamu bwe baagireetera obutaba nongoofu ni babingibwamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuba kiisi anaakolanga ekyenhinhalwa kyonakyona ku ebyo, anaabanga nga takaabalirwa mu bantu bange.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.18.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
